This is a hacky prototype of an indentational syntax in Scheme.
For example,

  define factorial n
    if =: n 0
       1
       * n 
	 factorial -: n 1

is like

  (define (factorial n)
    (if (= n 0)
        1
        (* n (factorial (- n 1)))))

